n't checked.\n\n**Name.** I renamed the model `anchored_concave_switch_impression`.\n\nFiles are in `/scratch/users/kushinm/auto-psych/outer_loop_live/run3/data/subjective_randomness/experiment3/model_loop/iter_3/candidate_3_repair_1/`:\n- hypothesis.md\n- model_name.txt\n- candidate.py","ttft_ms":6510,"type":"result","duration_ms":1445297,"uuid":"7d3185bf-9bca-466f-8290-197de7868e29","ttft_stream_ms":5133,"time_to_request_ms":118,"first_content_frame_ms":5134,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
